# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A CNOT(\"controlled NOT\" or CX) gate is a two-qubit gate, meaning its action involves two qubits at once: the control qubit and the target qubit. A CNOT flips the target qubit only when the control qubit is $|1\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "CNOT(\"controlled NOT\" 또는 CX) Gate는 2-Qubit Gate로, 제어 qubit(control qubit)과 표적 qubit(target qubit)이라는 두 Qubit에 동시에 작용합니다. CNOT은 제어 Qubit이 $|1\\rangle$일 때만 표적 Qubit을 반전시킵니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Input (target,control) | Output (target,control) |\n"
"|:-----------:|:------------:|\n"
"| 00          | 00           |\n"
"| 01          | 11           |\n"
"| 10          | 10           |\n"
"| 11          | 01           |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 입력 (target, control) | 출력 (target, control) |\n"
"|:-----------:|:------------:|\n"
"| 00          | 00           |\n"
"| 01          | 11           |\n"
"| 10          | 10           |\n"
"| 11          | 01           |\n"

# doq: emptied 2026-09-05, previous translation failed check.py
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
